  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Targets .NET 10. Previous releases targeted .NET 8; consumers on .NET 8 or 9 must stay on 1.0.10. Analytics modules and rules now expose structured parameters as OnvifElementItem (name plus raw XML) instead of a bare XML list, so a Modify can round-trip them without renaming the parameter. Adds two runnable samples: a console probe that exercises the whole public API against a camera, and a cross-platform Avalonia test bench.",
